2rARgBIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a"}},"showMoreText":{"simpleText":"...المزيد"},"showLessText":{"simpleText":"عرض محتوى أقل"},"trackingParams":"CPIBEM2rARgBIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a","defaultExpanded":false,"descriptionCollapsedLines":3,"showMoreCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPIBEM2rARgBIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CPIBEM2rARgBIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","changeEngagementPanelVisibilityAction":{"targetId":"engagement-panel-structured-description","visibility":"ENGAGEMENT_PANEL_VISIBILITY_EXPANDED"}},{"clickTrackingParams":"CPIBEM2rARgBIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","scrollToEngagementPanelCommand":{"targetId":"engagement-panel-structured-description"}}]}},"showLessCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPIBEM2rARgBIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","changeEngagementPanelVisibilityAction":{"targetId":"engagement-panel-structured-description","visibility":"ENGAGEMENT_PANEL_VISIBILITY_HIDDEN"}},"attributedDescription":{"content":"Learn More about WiFi 6 by TP-Link: https://www.tp-link.com/us/wifi6/best...\n\nWhat is WiFi 6? (also known as AX WiFi)  \n \nWiFi 6 is the next generation standard in WiFi technology. WiFi 6 also known as “AX WiFi or 802.11 ax WiFi” builds and improves on the current 802.11ac WiFi standard. \nWiFi 6 was originally built in response to the growing number of devices in the world. If you own a VR device, multiple smart home devices, or simply have a large number of devices in your household, then a WiFi 6 router might just be the best WiFi router for you. \n\nAX WiFi uses both 1024 QAM to provide a signal packed with more data (giving you more efficiency) and a 160 MHz Channel to provide a wider channel to make your WiFi faster. Experience stutter-free VR or enjoy stunningly vivid 4K and even 8K streaming. \n\nWiFi 6 uses 8x8 uplink/downlink, MU-MIMO, OFDMA, and BSS Color to provide up to 4x larger capacity and to handle more devices. \n\nL