al-Lens Solar Pan/Tilt Security Camera, 360° Smart Tracking, Free AI Detection \u0026 Color Night Vision","description":"The Tapo C645D Kit features a dual-lens design that combines a fixed 2K ultra-wide camera with a pan/tilt 2K telephoto lens, allowing you to monitor two areas simultaneously. One lens maintains continuous wide coverage, while the other zooms in and tracks motion for detailed visibility. Powered by solar energy with a built-in 10,000mAh rechargeable battery, the camera delivers reliable, maintenance-free security. Just one hour of sunlight can power a full day of operation, ensuring consistent protection even during cloudy periods. Advanced on-device AI detects people, pets, and vehicles without requiring a subscription. Smart detection reduces false alerts and sends more relevant notifications, keeping you informed of what truly matters around your home. Synchronized Smart Tracking links both lenses together. When motion is detected by the wide-angle lens, the pan/tilt camera automatically follows the subject. One-tap Smart Focus lets you instantly zoom and center on any point directly from the live view. Designed for outdoor reliability, the IP65-rated housing withstands rain, dust, and extreme temperatures. Flexible night vision modes include full-color night vision with spotlights or infrared for discreet monitoring, with local microSD storage up to 512GB or optional cloud storage.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcT2owAkENLnPDGoqP_Np2nehqjolq3Mk5QcxHUiBDHpchiQm0kV3d4oQWlnWXg7VOJYlHe7mTo","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQnDuEhg5O1HtxlMm_3n6XTBhd1gNaaUihwf2P855br753WjsnOc5DElDU5JZZ7o95OOxV5ysQ","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQaeJs8_-fN3Ej55Q7xBmvB5aWaV9UwSBMNAM4NEF-BvuMG9XisltSNzkkgB82yk6O3ekIVTRw","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏1,