 battery life in wire-free mode or hardwired 24/7 monitoring capability - Expansive 180° head-to-toe field of view identifies visitors and provides complete front yard coverage - 2K QHD live video captures crucial doorstep details with stunning clarity and enhanced resolution - Ring call feature sends phone calls to answer door without opening Tapo app for convenient access - Smart AI detection alerts for people, packages, and vehicles with no subscription fees required - 24/7 continuous recording in hardwired mode ensures complete activity monitoring around the clock - Pre-roll footage provides up to 4 extra seconds of video before motion detection triggers - Full-color night vision with built-in spotlights reveals faces, vehicles, and clothing after dark - Two-way audio with quick response presets enables clear conversations or automated replies via app - Local and cloud storage supports microSD cards up to 512GB or Tapo Care subscription service","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRYBgC_iISujaGFMqCxOfHAsT3yLCdVqYsti-cRY6VQflWgudi0utuSwdwysM9L57APHiW0qR8","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSliRV-4kVK-yrp--nPhLyVB44e-LJ9R2uvyJ1BNg1dSA0Mp-u2iTvBHsZmLhYoLwsqFiX93kw","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTXSMnyIG01p4aojQSNa9d0yulcrD7xzQnoikIbsFIlHdd-fD7mGdO1fWlVyJhfXlmjsK2enIA","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏930.51","vendorName":"TP-Link Tapo","trackingParams":"COwBEJP0ARgFIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COwBEJP0ARgFIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"COwBEJP0ARgFIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpJpTG