po","buttonAccessibilityText":"شراء سِلع من TP-Link Tapo","fromVendorText":"مِن TP-Link Tapo","additionalFeesText":"","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"TP-Link Deco 7 Pro BE63 BE10000 Whole Home Mesh Wi-Fi 7 System, 4K-QAM, 320 MHz Bandwidth, Connect Over 200 Devices, 3-Pack","description":"This TP-Link Deco 7 Pro BE63 BE10000 Mesh Wi-Fi 7 System (3-Pack) is the simple way to future-proof your home network with tri-band speed, wide coverage, and multi-gig connectivity. Experience next-generation connectivity with a Wi-Fi 7 tri-band mesh system delivering up to 10 Gbps total speed. Streaming, gaming, and video calls feel instant and consistent across your home. Blanket large spaces with whole-home coverage up to 7,600 sq.ft. Enjoy a strong, reliable signal in living rooms, bedrooms, offices, and outdoor areas without dead zones. Support more of what you love with capacity for 200+ connected devices. Phones, laptops, TVs, cameras, and smart home gadgets all stay fast and responsive. Build a faster wired backbone with 4× 2.5G multi-gig Ethernet ports. Plug in gaming consoles, streaming boxes, and workstations for peak performance.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTVJWdZgLpL19LtSJnnFS-5f_qgNbWvLjzy3k84xd_xHq8pmX8zCCSTt7JdN7dtV9DvpI8pzg7P","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQRKhBCLoV6M3MkJQhFtCi2xDXwTzl4o7E7PjFIJ6SLazF-dfAHDjk0GvK893cmWWzXrH8Ktekf","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTKtfFfE5_ly-Xgwwlo0ocWhwDNwENNhIIQH5HoYSCAvIWICLuxkHVo9tcZZS7SmXbaabtJwUEg","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏4,373.74","vendorName":"TP-Link Tapo","trackingParams":"COsBEJP0ARgGIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COsBEJP0ARgGIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8p