go zones, and multi-floor mapping supported. Easy control via Tapo App, Alexa, and Google Assistant. Ideal for busy households and pet owners, the RV30 Max Plus is your ultimate cleaning assistant.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRjR7Suyu1I2lvuYrOLLHpsDuRaVfTknkupgm7CoeVIcU6vZbzFEL67Mm4BGVrpU0omfAV1fEE","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTC62OesquD0Lxhfl7tGdlEZcThIqFl6GuBi-CXltI7KlJtJl7rY-QfVB-fS3Rk0q5V7iYfelY","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcR-YuvSDztfj4F84J771lUcALMOwEpx3ro3CysUitTv3jiSroGBcdT1Bc_o_5eT4hVBCC0xAK8","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏2,140.30","vendorName":"TP-Link Tapo","trackingParams":"COkBEJP0ARgIIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COkBEJP0ARgIIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"COkBEJP0ARgIIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpLhZknGtEuh-SiXAq8-OWmnbN1XAPvHBielLi4byVCBtgLfCU21gRli5ocEX_PQcr7rd7nwA-9eHQcA7oDRvsnfuFiJgpZalJCfONK0Ld5i8I5fWRfgE_mZEWZmPMUpswukMk1HaqHPik_zeDQrsRg4BSIlpwwnm-0mSjWataoA3B4yM8O6E-xaxyyp_wNE0omb8xTj49pr1V7p8sK8HkcFpa-0to1W0GzotfAqrLclx7HcERaQsnCSlkKQVRCgIAZC1p-ySGOmWYZGoWjkfwNtmaYzH3z6_3m5Fbf-yeHOVnXiO0VIwMGy0x5_tvw2MeM59Y2mjU92QolR9Jm1K073VXvE7GC-H0v9LBSW3RcDvGK4uPJNizwsxBkVkH8ZnbINFMI3mmMJPwyDytaVVPtpTNUc7qsi5ANLxU0O_Klc8bU1XooErRPSRu8lpm8Hf9JP-sP-QPDmYn7AIjbVKPk-u3F1opfeUCdOcfhrS88xQ3pHb0BXRIMCJge1Dv3pZqZB8ukoytwAesatVRf_qLLphSB35OVhpwSfc8Glb7KB4lGd-tU0oPKHj7Sf1gi790F-DVwDhywitX5GFpQ1dRAb3MHu1hS4dWvADTOgUez0eW2jlTiS_t--L941FmR4FI23veRERzUyvKqmMyOB3N3ePQyq_4i14LC5ESaT92R11DBTA5os9WElbPH7Y2u81tbZ0GGe-vLynbdB9iof22o1jZ7I-amA0IhLMt-0GaI0sXEJeZf5x72mbCGRdthMx