 plus support for added storage via a 2.5'' SATA HDD/SSD (sold separately). Access recordings without subscriptions or having to buy separate microSDs for each camera. Adds Facial Recognition to Existing Tapo Cameras. Filter out familiar faces and get alerts only when an unfamiliar person is detected, reducing unnecessary notifications. Flexible Viewing Options. Watch live or recorded footage on your phone or tablet, or monitor up to 4 live views on a larger screen via the built-in HDMI port. Trusted Data Protection. Advanced WPA3 encryption defends your footage from unauthorized access, ensuring your data stays private and secure. Instant Security Overview. Use the Tapo App to view all device activity at a glance, access daily summaries, and quickly locate events using tags. Built-In Alarm \u0026 Chime. 110dB alarm not only alerts you to detected intruders but can also conveniently act as a chime when connected to Tapo smart doorbells. Whether you choose Wi-Fi or Ethernet, the Tapo H500 offers reliable connectivity and full integration with the Tapo app, giving you a complete security overview and smarter control of your home.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRlSU_W2l9o5Lm7ERS2DQnsAwpwb_4_b5VCGp_Y_DA-63acaqTlMWrmlVgJV1MKnn6y2IU_nvRD","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ9EMmVkzOahbzyoswy8Bz2R0551a8J2GOBIsvbZ2i0mjxD6oQVSBysO2HVC3qUPliLmP12-yK8","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTX_su_U5inUzuiMNWn2E-kpkM0YwVujN94h3Z-aAKKtJl_Ox-0Hqz1cJ6LOmCbQBP6xpfxQJvZ","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏1,395.82","vendorName":"TP-Link Tapo","trackingParams":"COgBEJP0ARgJIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COgBEJP0ARgJIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"COgBE