nlight keeps it running, while the built-in 10,000 mAh battery provides up to 200 days of backup power. Dual-band Wi-Fi ensures smooth, stable streaming from anywhere. Built to endure the elements, this outdoor security camera boasts an IP66 weatherproof design. Smart AI detection accurately identifies people, vehicles, and pets—sending only the alerts that matter and reducing false notifications. Protect your world effortlessly with the Tapo C460 Kit. Wire-free, weatherproof, and always watching over what matters most.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRnV8QGnqty172Igvx5z2EShQ5jlgcdpu_ZjRRvColHuYQrZkXskJtzCWPmdLdE97z1_SNSgkAJ","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTaHRZrAKtPDSjCJRowjSo3xKeD73CDA8RalZBlPNEd13UPSUfX4LJmRj5yyWk-dMNw0Yf_re6P","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQoYMJNLoKdEuyXyDOGpVj0hJfK_5GJswtrV2y2-_j2RoNfayFUXXX2oUd5w0M23f9g1-FUs7ZK","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏2,047.14","vendorName":"TP-Link Tapo","trackingParams":"COUBEJP0ARgMIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COUBEJP0ARgMIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"COUBEJP0ARgMIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpLTtv7NckchthmM9Q-_ZQUoOHXI2JQkxgsjsx5Tx55wte2VtvuRuVNQQ56qEfGJBmYoiBA2CNRVj-9LJfLCV5PxlKEXM8h5Djf9Zq-j6VpLcioEoUSN4mCaqoN3ul3lZ1HY7IWmlQXrhfizbsFPLgugPVTArpXbPobGAQ3wrRGNfpNmb28SaPByAUHLK0VdvATcg7uYLazDGy841lr6M0dbO6w1Ie4FDEusAA68shnhmSBsW4v9vrnfi9a7i0WRDTX4bXWr_1NE-YPCiRTx1BPZuAwHEKlY-Cj-TT7LGGdMN2d7oYrcB7RztDmi76VHl1-etp8bKOzWa2g97YQMDqDvSfsiW3vT1Xk5tQzqKHjK8LLpDLYUKikkf2TOtwFRZQ1Uy-Bhgu6yD7OJ71sINqZF4XLL4quWYoo-kGOiZzsx-doA3Gvwg7