apo C460 Kit MagCam 4K Solar-Powered Security Camera, Free Smart AI Detection, Full-Color Night Vision \u0026 200 Days Battery Life","description":"Tapo C460 Kit is a solar-powered 4K security camera built to protect your home with clarity, intelligence, and style. Offering true peace of mind in every moment. Capture life in stunning 4K Ultra HD with enhanced edge sharpness, revealing every detail from distant faces to small objects. Even at night, the starlight sensor and built-in spotlights deliver vivid color night vision for faster and more accurate monitoring. Enjoy uninterrupted protection powered by the sun. Just 45 minutes of daily sunlight keeps it running, while the built-in 10,000 mAh battery provides up to 200 days of backup power. Dual-band Wi-Fi ensures smooth, stable streaming from anywhere. Built to endure the elements, this outdoor security camera boasts an IP66 weatherproof design. Smart AI detection accurately identifies people, vehicles, and pets—sending only the alerts that matter and reducing false notifications. Protect your world effortlessly with the Tapo C460 Kit. Wire-free, weatherproof, and always watching over what matters most.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTgEI2EjVLGHdKEAuSMdqJtJrmYO8q6Hh0IfHsxeqkdnhK9onq9fjXzSbxMVSR9dUqjmNW3XmjK","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSslKpkP_MAvrqIvakQoSOl02E7yj_8ZdkboyICAMRLnz_aXm-EpPbkTg_kX_PCtXsSnS1QioJo","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcT8QfjBGWoaCPi95wttHE5eDQ3MOnNnTOhP5jnnmvbYy8ecrlU4yLibB9n3y39eBsKmmHBdJamo","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏1,395.82","vendorName":"TP-Link Tapo","trackingParams":"COQBEJP0ARgNIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COQBEJP0ARgNIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":