inuous, maintenance-free operation, pair it with the Tapo A200 solar panel for nonstop protection. With AI smart detection, the C425 recognizes people, pets, and vehicles while customizable activity zones reduce false alerts. Built with IP66 weatherproofing, it’s designed to perform in any outdoor environment - keeping your home safe day and night.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS7ptWatdyIU3_rIqKdpVuih1p8OuskwCBkiXpYcBcWBxN43ZjVpvgEvSTYZcBmAgQhu5v3cGE","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRvZbV4yxitV_FpkpNPPApezeJHmrW43cnsxLy0bM8ymAD5ro-HRALeE92FcD5vY4SRfahSYLw","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcR3icAcaF1WgNYyTuzQXfJlCnRVh_HI_pwFRmBVqCORz7fZnklCRVBb6KWqqpWgAFWV8cbzzEo","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏837.45","vendorName":"TP-Link Tapo","trackingParams":"COIBEJP0ARgPIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COIBEJP0ARgPIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"COIBEJP0ARgPIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpIfLl-C2Kcwz3a1jorOdwqJQQfn1VmXaJfDxIPnHxBx9KN6oZVKUxgCJ9XNp7lnNnrE_ARex2yf0PD0dqphIEpRStucy9wbI6cge8zCm4sina5_J1Kqbv4vbB7E_-I1ip7b8NOCz23cR2bxR3HQSlbhwh3b5icYhfAq93OdLKidf5XXjrebgO8ITfkhpFJv9PZdyg88O8ksmsXw2PJ7eOb2ZifX7FzpL2t5Mb4En1agAw9a1eMCH5JB2bzlysLvv6EpH0YqFtGUKo_-Etjk2IHFCPE267k3xDQgW0Cjpxs-IwdDaAIOiNt6RkwkbMWpEBa_ERoktFD26z2k8us7aIcKYFHz7a00ZzSF8vOITP_8MqlVuQqNWTwgBiRwyfTo4MAATJCTz-5mdX96rGKjEa9oNNEpZ64kSA8JQ2Xnyxqdh-ddDqiOvmgSGfJb-bmDGZVlxWjX81vSrnbS9AZt7k6JcHiI9za67FQuFz0Jjpy3s7XnXdGY92JGgGM9_-UWOIdzXPgKrZ1YMC26vx-0gfxlyPKSYlp5pRTqD6Bqc6b3AxAjM0Zo6PxnyYAEdgpxohi7H8_Pn6yzdVJ7EJX4rbrwhrl0BSEpqWvywOqZJY