Solar Security Camera. Its detachable solar panel keeps the built-in battery charged year-round, delivering reliable power for truly worry-free home security. Easy Wire-Free Installation Anywhere. No outlets or tangled cables—just freedom. Mount this wireless outdoor security camera and solar panel together or separately using the 13ft cable, so you can protect front porches, driveways, gardens, or even remote sheds with ease. Crisp 2K QHD Video \u0026 142° Wide View. Capture every detail in 2K ultra-clear video. The 142° wide field of view lets you monitor more area with fewer blind spots, making it ideal for complete smart home security coverage. AI Detection \u0026 All-Weather Protection. AI motion detection recognizes people, vehicles, and pets while filtering false alerts. With IP66 weatherproofing, color night vision, two-way audio, and a built-in siren, this smart security camera stands guard day and night, rain or shine. Peace of Mind, Every Day. From setup to daily use, the Tapo C425 Kit brings seamless security to your life. Enjoy a smarter, safer home—powered by the sun and designed to protect what matters most.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRY1F2cccW-VuoOlJR0fYr49WUPe5udtKC9DtHcypC7M7CUU9BiqIupZ7yqYwkczYUkbTUGjFPQ","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSLJoPBLPPV6N38Vne6LtNFiloqZBgHBd5X7PKN_zaIEJV8HaQOHOAGm1Q621ISBultpyv5Jdab","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTop466-R3uQP2h8Zkvo1jCZ_uXJZPW9AGRSxSwVthw4ogxGv3qEzVZNuVv-N_fS-76DX1quSlg","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏930.51","vendorName":"TP-Link Tapo","trackingParams":"COEBEJP0ARgQIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4a","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COEBEJP0ARgQIhMIwYSF0MmJlgMVHvgRCB3dxg4aygEEs8pCnA==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"COEBEJP0ARgQ